<section class="tab details {{tab.cssClass}}" data-group="primary" data-tab="details">
  <div class="form-grid">
    <label><span>Fits</span><select name="system.target">{{selectOptions config.modTargets selected=system.target}}</select></label>
    <label class="check" data-tooltip="Fitted, it hides what it is fitted to: that item, and what is on it, does not count toward concealment"><input type="checkbox" name="system.concealsHost" {{checked system.concealsHost}}><span>Conceals its host</span></label>
  </div>
  <p class="hint">Fit a mod by dragging it onto a weapon or armor tray on the operative's Combat tab. One of each mod per item. A mod's effects (Effects tab) apply to the operative only while it is fitted.</p>
  {{> "systems/irop/templates/item/physical.hbs"}}
</section>
